<title>UK: Celltech H1 losses widen.</title>
<headline>Celltech H1 losses widen.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		7.9 loss	     vs 5.2 loss</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 nil		    vs nil</p>
<p> Pretax		     5.9 loss	     vs 3.7 loss</p>
<p> Turnover		   9.4		    vs 12.2</p>
<p>NOTE - Celltech, which last week announced the failure of its lead product, said its strategic alliances and strong financial position &quot;will continue to underpin its substantial R&amp;D investment until the company enters sustained profitability.&quot;</p>
<p>Full company name - Celltech Group Plc.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
